# ⚠ risc5.js, risc5.wasm, oberon.dsk and prom_sd.mem are NOT ignored: GitHub Pages
# serves static files as is, and there is nothing to build wasm with at deploy time
# (it needs verilator and emsdk). They are rebuilt by the `web` target, and changes
# show up in the diff. They used to be ignored here and lived as hand-made copies in
# site/oberon/; the copy went stale silently.
